      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "滚轮以鼠标位置缩放，Ctrl+滚轮亦同；水平滚轮平移，中键拖曳或空白键加左键拖曳平移。阅读模式左键拖曳平移；倍率控制提供默认比例、适合内容及重设视角。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-19",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2234,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 18,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "视角锁定停止平移与滚轮缩放，避免讲解误移。工具列与角落的锁定指示同步变化，解锁後可再次移动视野。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-20",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2382,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 19,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "06 · 导览与工具列",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-21",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2444,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 20,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "停靠位置",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-22",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2506,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 21,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "上方导览包含首页、阅读／编辑、图钉、＋插入、更多、存档状态及固定开关；未固定时鼠标离开会收合。勾号表示已存，虚线圆表示待存、保存中或尚未完成。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-23",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2598,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "拖工具列握把到四边，上下横排、左右直排。更多→自订工具列可显示、隐藏与排序，隐藏的项目仍在更多工具。「物件图层」有工具列入口与独立面板；屏幕工具列不显示卷轴。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-24",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2690,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 170,
      "zIndex": 23,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首页设定或「更多 → 自订工具列」可选只有图示，或图示与文字分页。图文模式分成常用、绘图、插入、管理；选择（V）固定常驻。工具只排一行／一列，空间不足用两端箭头切换工具组，不增加工具排数。自订窗口左侧勾选显示，另勾「常用」挑选常用分页；仍可全选、默认及排序。所有应用程序内面板与对话框固定使用黑板的纸白／绿色设计，不随 Windows 亮暗主题切换；系统档案挑选器由 Windows 管理。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-25",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2872,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 140,
      "zIndex": 24,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "工具列默认为「图示与文字」，常用分页预先包含笔刷与线条样式；可在自订工具列调整。首次使用会加入「操作说明 · 全工具指南」无边界笔记，涵盖全部工具及可编辑范例。用中键拖曳／空白键加拖曳平移，滚轮缩放，开图钉清单可跳到各章。旧范例与已编辑作品不会被覆写；修改或删除新指南後不会每次重建。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-26",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3080,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 25,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "07 · 画笔与笔刷",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-27",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3142,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 26,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "钢笔 · 萤光笔 · 油漆笔刷 · 笔刷与物件设定 · 遮题胶带",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-28",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3204,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 27,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "选画笔，再点色圆调颜色、粗细、透明度及种类：向量笔、钢笔、铅笔、水彩、萤光笔、蜡笔、书法、油漆。偏好会保存；笔迹为平滑向量，笔刷名称不代表物理材质模拟，完成後可移动或改色。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-29",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3326,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 140,
      "zIndex": 28,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "向量笔近似直线，保持按住且停一秒可吸附直线，移动超过12 pt恢撤销预览；放开才提交一笔可撤销操作。更多工具的遮题胶带可遮住题目，双击或物件设定揭示／遮住，支援撤销。 钢笔、萤光笔及油漆笔刷完成後不会自动选择或显示框线；按V再点选物件可移动、缩放或旋转，双击才开详细属性。板擦保留左高右低，长边缩短20%，厚度不变。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
